== Effects ==
* When used, the next shot will fire a large, {{i|Brimstone}}-like laser in the direction Isaac shoots that deals double Isaac's [[Damage|tear damage]]. If Isaac is already shooting, the item immediately activates in that direction.
** {{dlc|nr}} The laser hits up to 13 times.
** {{dlc|r}} The laser hits up to 12 times.
** {{dlc|a+}} [[Status effect]]s can be applied by the laser.

== Notes ==
* This item can drop from killing {{E|Envy}} {{dlc|na+}} or {{e|Super Envy}}. {{dlc|nr}} Envy and Super Envy can drop this item even if Isaac has already encountered/possessed it. 
* Despite the laser looking very similar to Brimstone, it doesn't share most of the Brimstone-specific interactions.
* Can still be used while [[blindfolded]].
* This item synergizes extremely well with items that significantly increase damage, such as {{i|Polyphemus}} and {{i|Ipecac}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|4.5 Volt}}: Allows the item to be charged and used multiple times in a room, which can help with dealing extra damage in enduring fights like most endgame bosses.
* {{i|9 Volt}}: Can be used once every room, and more frequently in {{R|Challenge Room}}s.
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns white wisps in the outer ring that resemble Shoop da Whoop!. The wisps will not fire tears, but will each fire a thin Shoop da Whoop! laser whenever Isaac uses it (including the wisp that was just summoned). The lasers deal 7 damage per tick (BUG: 3.5 if Isaac has {{I|BFFS!}}), and can hit up to 10 times for a total of 70 damage.}}
* {{t|Broken Remote}}: Since item charges aren't expended until Isaac chooses a direction to shoot, the player can teleport across the floor indefinitely.
* {{i|Hemoptysis}}: Enemies hit by the sneeze will gain a curse that increases the power of the laser by 2× and +3 flat damage, on top of the 2× base damage already applied by Shoop da Whoop. Enemies who die to the laser under the curse will damage and spread the curse to nearby enemies.
* {{i|Ipecac}}: Increases the damage of the beam greatly, as Ipecac's +40 flat damage boost is added straight to Shoop Da Whoop whithout any damage decrease unlike {{i|Brimstone}}. This basically allows Isaac to kill most normal bosses in 1 shot.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Car Battery}}: No effect.

