== Trivia ==
* Shoop da Whoop! is a reference to an internet meme depicting an edited face of [https://dragonball.fandom.com/wiki/Cell Cell] from the anime ''Dragon Ball Z'' firing a laser from its mouth. This meme is usually accompanied by the quote "I'm-a firin' mah lazar!", followed by "BLLLARRRRGGG!", which is where the item's tooltip comes from.

